  "sections": {
   "install": {
    "title": "Download",
    "html": "<p>If you want to support my continued work on LosslessCut, and you want the advantage of a secure and simple installation process with automatic, stable updates, consider getting it from your favorite store:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id1505323402\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mifi/lossless-cut/master/mac-app-store-badge.svg\" alt=\"Mac App Store\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"50\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/store/apps/9P30LSR4705L?cid=storebadge&amp;ocid=badge\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mifi/lossless-cut/master/ms-store-badge.svg\" alt=\"MS badge\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"50\" /></a></p>\n<p>For Linux I publish to the Snap Store:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://snapcraft.io/losslesscut\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mifi/lossless-cut/master/snap-store-black.svg?sanitize=true\" alt=\"Snapcraft\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"50\" /></a></p>\n<p>If you prefer to download the executables manually, this will of course always be free (see also <a href=\"https://losslesscut.app/docs/requirements\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supported operating systems</a>):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>macOS: <a href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/releases/latest/download/LosslessCut-mac-x64.dmg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Intel</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/releases/latest/download/LosslessCut-mac-arm64.dmg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple Silicon</a> DMG (note that PKG does <strong>not</strong> work)</li>\n<li>Windows: <a href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/releases/latest/download/LosslessCut-win-x64.7z\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">7zip</a> (Windows 7, 8 and 8.1 is <a href=\"https://losslesscut.app/docs/requirements\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">no longer supported after v3.50.0</a>)</li>\n<li>Linux: <a href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/releases/latest/download/LosslessCut-linux-x64.tar.bz2\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">x64 tar.bz2</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/releases/latest/download/LosslessCut-linux-x86_64.AppImage\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">x64 AppImage</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/releases/latest/download/LosslessCut-linux-arm64.tar.bz2\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">arm64 tar.bz2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/releases\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">More releases</a> - Note that APPX (Windows) and PKG (macOS) do <strong>not</strong> work</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mifi.no/llc/nightly/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Latest nightly builds 🧪</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Note that the above are the <a href=\"https://losslesscut.app/docs/faq#can-i-download-losslesscut-from-other-websites-or-package-managers\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">only official downloads</a>. There are also unofficial releases like <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/details/no.mifi.losslesscut\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Flathub</a> (not maintained by me). Difference between App Stores and GitHub download? <a href=\"https://losslesscut.app/docs/faq#is-losslesscut-free-whats-the-difference-between-the-app-store-and-github-versions\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Please see FAQ</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mifi.no/thanks\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mifi/lossless-cut/master/donate.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></p>\n<p>LosslessCut is maintained by me alone and will always remain free and open source. If it's useful to you, consider supporting my work. Alternatively <a href=\"https://www.ffmpeg.org/donations.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">donate to the FFmpeg team</a> because they are doing the world a huge favor.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://paypal.me/mifino/usd\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Paypal</a> | <a href=\"https://mifi.no/thanks\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">crypto</a> | <a href=\"https://mifi.no/thanks\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">more</a></p>",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 2740
   },
   "usage": null,
   "features": {
    "title": "Features",
    "html": "<ul>\n<li>Cut and trim video and audio losslessly, in seconds</li>\n<li>Merge cut segments, or whole files with identical codecs, losslessly</li>\n<li>Add, remove, replace or extract tracks: audio, subtitles and more</li>\n<li>Change the format (remux), for example from MKV to MP4, without re-encoding</li>\n<li>Segments, markers and tags, with import/export of chapters, CSV, EDL and more</li>\n<li>Detect scenes, black frames and silence, and split by them</li>\n<li>Edit metadata and rotation, and create chapters</li>\n<li>Opens almost any format, even ones your player can't play</li>\n<li>Snapshots and frame export, keyboard shortcuts, a <a href=\"https://losslesscut.app/docs/cli\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CLI</a> and an <a href=\"https://losslesscut.app/docs/api\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HTTP API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://losslesscut.app/docs/features\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">All features and example use cases →</a></strong></p>\n<p>See also the <a href=\"https://losslesscut.app/docs/recipes\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Recipe cookbook</a>.</p>",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 824
   }
